    "updated_at": "2026-10-09T09:49:27Z",
    "body": "Thank you for the thorough review and the positive decision from the legal team meeting!\n\nWe are glad to accept the suggested short identifier PDL-Japan-1.0, which aligns well with the naming convention used by the OGL family of licenses.\n\nWe also acknowledge the important note regarding the official text: the Japanese version is the authoritative text, and the English version is provided for reference purposes only. We will make sure this is clearly reflected when the files are prepared.\n\nCould you let us know if there is anything we need to do on our end to help move this forward? For example, should we prepare any files or provide additional information?\n\nWe look forward to seeing PDL-Japan-1.0 added to the SPDX License List and appreciate the careful consideration given to this request.",
